    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "side_txt",
      "x": 755,
      "y": 155,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 750,
      "text": "ACTUAL TEST EXECUTION VALUES (backend/validation/worked_example.py):\n\n\u2022 Model: rf-100-lofo-fixed (Parameters Frozen)\n\u2022 Weather Prov: category=historical_fallback, age=69d\n\u2022 Satellite Prov: radius=1440m, valid_pixel=92.0%\n\u2022 Digest: SHA-256 609aa86f21cee0c64c041bf170d1b5f6...\n\u2022 Thermal Time: GDD = 1828.91\u00b0C (Base=10.0\u00b0C)\n\u2022 Anomaly Vector: Rain -9.10%, ET0 -4.74%, Tmax +2.67\u00b0C\n\u2022 Skill Weights: h=1: 0.656, h=7: 0.501, h=21: 0.431\n\u2022 Spatial Trust: R2=0.852, residual_rms=0.00481 -> 'high'\n\u2022 Conflict Code: WEATHER_STRESS_NDVI_NORMAL\n\u2022 Quality Key: Whistorical_fallback|Vhigh|Cconflict\n\u2022 Selected Partition: Whistorical_fallback|Vhigh|C* (n=20)\n\u2022 Guarantee: heuristic_inflated_pooled (Inflation=1.35x)\n\u2022 Ridge Correction: +19.00% (Bounds: -100% to +94.71%)\n\u2022 Final Output: 4.7466 t/ha, Interval: [1.6372, 7.8561]\n\u2022 Actual Ground Truth: 2.89 t/ha (Covered inside interval)\n\u2022 Ledger Hash: SHA-256 d855f55cd9a428242ec628380441...\n\u2022 Replay Verification: reproduced=True (Zero external queries)",
      "originalText": "ACTUAL TEST EXECUTION VALUES (backend/validation/worked_example.py):\n\n\u2022 Model: rf-100-lofo-fixed (Parameters Frozen)\n\u2022 Weather Prov: category=historical_fallback, age=69d\n\u2022 Satellite Prov: radius=1440m, valid_pixel=92.0%\n\u2022 Digest: SHA-256 609aa86f21cee0c64c041bf170d1b5f6...\n\u2022 Thermal Time: GDD = 1828.91\u00b0C (Base=10.0\u00b0C)\n\u2022 Anomaly Vector: Rain -9.10%, ET0 -4.74%, Tmax +2.67\u00b0C\n\u2022 Skill Weights: h=1: 0.656, h=7: 0.501, h=21: 0.431\n\u2022 Spatial Trust: R2=0.852, residual_rms=0.00481 -> 'high'\n\u2022 Conflict Code: WEATHER_STRESS_NDVI_NORMAL\n\u2022 Quality Key: Whistorical_fallback|Vhigh|Cconflict\n\u2022 Selected Partition: Whistorical_fallback|Vhigh|C* (n=20)\n\u2022 Guarantee: heuristic_inflated_pooled (Inflation=1.35x)\n\u2022 Ridge Correction: +19.00% (Bounds: -100% to +94.71%)\n\u2022 Final Output: 4.7466 t/ha, Interval: [1.6372, 7.8561]\n\u2022 Actual Ground Truth: 2.89 t/ha (Covered inside interval)\n\u2022 Ledger Hash: SHA-256 d855f55cd9a428242ec628380441...\n\u2022 Replay Verification: reproduced=True (Zero external queries)",
